1
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,360
Be careful.

2
00:01:33,479 --> 00:01:35,610
So you are really sick, Sixth Brother.

3
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:37,560
I thought you were

4
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:41,720
with Mr. Su.

5
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:46,890
I've been busy with official evaluations recently.

6
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,780
I gave orders not to be disturbed.

7
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:51,440
I didn't expect to neglect you, Third Brother.

8
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:52,680
I'm really sorry.

9
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,640
You guys are really something.

10
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,400
This is my mansion.

11
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,920
When is Third Brother not allowed here?

12
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,880
You're making a fuss over nothing.

13
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:04,090
I wonder what brings you here, Third Brother.

14
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:07,100
Why not have a cup of tea before you go?

15
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:16,650
My beloved wife has been away for days.

16
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:18,400
I have missed you so much.

17
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,020
I'll take my leave.

18
00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:58,440
Xiyao.

19
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:02,280
Why did you come back with me,

20
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:07,280
grind ink and make soup for me?

21
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:10,160
We are husband and wife.

22
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,600
It is my duty to do so.

23
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:18,329
You touched Su Zhiye with this hand today.

24
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,300
It displeased me greatly.

25
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:25,120
I just casually pushed him aside.

26
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:43,400
I still have things to do.

27
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,500
Go back and rest first.

28
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:49,520
I do have a favor to ask of you.

29
00:03:52,320 --> 00:03:54,180
According to our Rouran customs,

30
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:57,560
I am supposed to take you back for a week after our wedding.

31
00:03:58,480 --> 00:04:00,120
If it's inconvenient for you,

32
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,840
I can go back by myself.

33
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,520
What if I refuse?

34
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:10,250
I'll go back and rest first.

35
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:16,660
I was serious when I said we are husband and wife.

36
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,360
I wasn't rejecting you just now.

37
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:22,490
I was just a little nervous.

38
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:44,200
Xiyao.

39
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,120
Don't go back.

40
00:06:49,159 --> 00:06:50,720
I can leave with you.

41
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:52,400
If you want to return to Rouran,

42
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:53,680
I can accompany you.

43
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:45,170
It's good that you're back.

44
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:47,880
I have no excuse.

45
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:49,040
Xiyao.

46
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,040
Before you appeared,

47
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:55,120
I never thought about

48
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:57,840
besides the supreme throne,

49
00:07:57,880 --> 00:07:59,240
what else I wanted.

50
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:03,480
But now,

51
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:05,600
I also want you.

52
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:08,600
Look at your hands.

53
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:16,280
I know what you want to do,

54
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:18,680
and I know what you have done.

55
00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:20,800
The ridiculous thing is,

56
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,970
I'm still here waiting for you.

57
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:26,240
I was afraid you wouldn't come back after seeing Su Zhiye.

58
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,720
You don't blame me?

59
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,840
Are you really so naive to think

60
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:39,100
that Yuwen Jingxuan will be fine after getting the Soul Jade back?

61
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:41,799
That I have no other way?

62
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:43,880
That everything will be at peace?

63
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:58,680
You're bleeding.

64
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:00,620
Stop picking it up.

65
00:09:02,280 --> 00:09:03,360
You too.

66
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:35,360
This is the Soul Jade Xiyao got back from Yuwen Jia.

67
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,360
Where is he?

68
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,160
He went back.

69
00:10:00,760 --> 00:10:01,820
Zhiluo, Miss Tang.

70
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,880
Jingxuan.

71
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:08,680
Miss Tang, Jingxuan.
